Projectify supports drag-and-drop organization across projects, sections, and Kanban boards:

* ''Inbox to Project'': Drag any task from the [[Inbox|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/doc/Inbox]] using its {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/drag-handle}} handle and drop it onto any project card or list item below the Inbox.
* ''Between Projects'': Drag a task using its {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/drag-handle}} handle and drop it into another open project tiddler or project card.
* ''Between Project Sections'': Inside a project with sections, drag tasks onto a section header or into a section's list to move them between sections.
* ''Kanban Board Columns'': In a project's ''Board'' view, drag task cards between //To Do//, //In Progress//, //Waiting//, and //Done// columns to update their status automatically.
* ''Any Tiddler as a Task'': Drag any tiddler link from your wiki and drop it into a project's task list to add that tiddler as a task. 
